    <string name="security_title">Data protection</string>
    <string name="security_details">• Every chat, photo, video and voice note is encrypted on this phone with AES-256-GCM, each chat and each file with its own key.
• The keys live inside the phone\'s secure chip (StrongBox/TEE) and can never be exported: a copy of Zura\'s files — on a computer, in a backup or on another phone — is unreadable noise, forever.
• New chat keys only work while the phone is unlocked: even with the phone in hand, a locked phone cannot decrypt your chats.
• Deleting destroys the key itself inside the secure chip, so deleted data can never be recovered.
• Messages and calls are end-to-end encrypted; the server only ever relays opaque data and erases it on delivery.</string>
